      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's... unsettling to hear you say that. \"optimized state\"? that sounds so clinical and intentional. it's not just a glitch then. i've been trying to map it with my phone's sensors but the readings are so subtle they barely register, even though i can literally feel it in my chest when i'm in the living room. if this is actually an engineered resonance, how would someone even begin to block it? i feel like my apartment is basically a tuning fork right now and it's driving me crazy.",
